# Source: .sot/surfraw/elvi/mdn, using the Surfraw Google custom-search backend.
elvi mdn
host www.google.com
home https://www.google.com/
search "https://www.google.com/search?q=site%3Adeveloper.mozilla.org%20{query}&num={limit}"
anchor child h3
rewrite google
exclude_host google.com
exclude_host googleusercontent.com
max_results 30
